ow but  regardless it still is a marvel project  and we could be getting another  spider-man in this film we have seen a  spider-man on the wall in the trailer we  have seen some photos of the daily  beagle talking about spider-man so  clearly he is in this universe somehow  but even if he wasn't morbius does look  like a genuinely good movie that i am  excited to see then kicking off the next  month the film that everybody is waiting  for and talking about right now doctor  strange in the multiverse of madness now  coming out of spider-man no way home so  much is expected of this movie  especially since it's exploring the  multiverse i keep saying it but anything  can literally happen doctor strange has  already stated in spider-man knowing  home there are infinite amounts of  universes out there alternate universes  which means anything could happen they  could literally go into the old fox  universes they've already brought back  old characters and spiderman no way home  wants to stop them from doing it again  and we assume they're going to be  exploring more than a handful of  universes so maybe we see even more old  characters maybe we see some new  characters there's a lot happening in  2022 with marvel but i think i am most  excited for multiverse of madness now  next up we actually don't have an exact  release date for yet but the she-hulk  series and this looks like it's going to  be a pretty fun series we have tatiana  mislady playing she-hulk's last jennifer  walters her cousin bruce banner is also  going to be in the series and mark  ruffalo of course is returning to play  him and it sounds like marvel has more  plans for the hulk mark ruffalo's hulk  in the mcu so perhaps this could be a  setup for the next hulk film and of  course abomination is coming back we  kind of already saw him in chongqing the  legend of the ten rings will he be a  villain or a hero or an anti-hero or  what in she-hulk we're not sure yet but  if i had to put this release somewhere i  would probably say it's going to come  around may or june just because there's  a gap there and i think they would want  to release miss marvel towards the  latter half of the year because the  marvels is going to come up and they  probably want them somewhat close  together but then we get in july thor  love and thunder and i know i said i was  really excited for doctor strange too  and i really am but thor love and  thunder i think is also going to be  phenomenal russell crowe is going to be  in the movie as zeus christian bale is  going to be in the movie as gore the  godbutcher natalie portman is returning  as jane foster and she's going to be  picking up the mantle of thor not taking  the place of arthor but a different  version of thor and she'll be wielding a  minded mjolnir and chris hemsworth said  that he is in the best shape of his life  that he's ever been for thor and judging  by some of the pictures that he has  shared on his instagram that is 100 true  and it looks like we're going to be  seeing the best version of thor and  taika watiti who of course directed thor  ragnarok one of my favorite mcu movies  has said that this movie is going to be  even better than the last and it's going  to be insane so i'm really really  excited for july we then have two marvel  disney plus shows that we don't really  know when they're going to come out  those two are miss marvel and the i am  groot show now since october through  december is pretty full already with  some marvel movies and projects coming  out we could probably put these two  airing on disney plus somewhere between  july and september they are all stated  to be coming out in 2022 and that seems  to be kind of the only time period where  they could go and again they probably  want miss marvel to come out somewhat  close to 2023 when we're getting the  marvels and i think everybody is excited  for the im groot special but october  through december like i said is full in  october we have across the spiderverse  part one and although this isn't an mcu  project it sure does look like the  possibility of tom holland spider-man  showing up could actually happen we're  not expecting it but tom holland has  played a little bit coy when he's been  asked about it and even if he's not the  continuation of into the spiderverse a  film that really a ton of people loved  is just so exciting to think about miles  morales gwen stacy peter parker and a  whole bunch of other spider-man on  screen so that's coming out on october  7th and then in october we have the  werewolf by night halloween special  coming to disney plus this doesn't have  an official release date yet but since  it's going to be a halloween special we  obviously assume that it's going to be  in october not much is really known  about the series at this point in time  however in the moon night trailer we do  see moon knight beating the crap out of  werewolf by night so werewolf by night  will have been introduced to the mcu  before the halloween special comes out  and i'm not really sure what to expect  from the series but i do like the more  spooky side of the mcu so i'm excited  for it and then of course in november we  have black panther 2 wakanda forever now  there's a ton of speculation going on  right now about this movie now of course  some of this won't come true but there's  talks about dr doom showing up perhaps  he wants some vibranium and knows that  wakanda has it neymar the submariner's  showing up because of some casting calls  that marvel studio put out and of course  if you consider the history between  wakanda and atlantis they don't get  along they are at war with each other  most of the time so it would be pretty  great to see neymar pop up but the big  question of course about black panther 2  is who is going to be the new black  panther marvel studios has already  stated they're not recasting t'challa  but that doesn't mean that they're not  going to get a new black panther it  could